# AK Fusion — repo names

Product: **AK Fusion**.

Three independent repositories:

- **cursor-node-api** — Agent API. Only this talks to the database (MySQL). All business logic and DB access live here. It owns the database.
- **cursor-admin-ui** — the admin portal (out of scope here).
- **cursor-customer-portal** — this Website portal. HTTP client of Agent API. Never connects to the database.

This folder must never access MySQL. It calls Agent API (`cursor-node-api`) only.

Never bypass tenant isolation.

Never trust a client-supplied `company_id` for authorization.
